{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, שָׁלוּ","hw":"שָׁלוּ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁלוּ</span></big>  <strong>n.f. neglect, remissness (</strong>𝔗 id.<strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:22\" href=\"/Ezra.4.22\">Ezr 4:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:9\" href=\"/Ezra.6.9\">6:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:5\" href=\"/Daniel.6.5\">Dn 6:5</a> + <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:29\" href=\"/Daniel.3.29\">3:29</a> Qr; Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁלה</span> usually thought an error for <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁלו</span>; Hi Bev M (perhaps) expl. as <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁלָה</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאֵלָה</span> = <em>thing, affair</em> (<a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:14\" href=\"/Daniel.4.14\">4:14</a>).","next":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁלֵוָה","prev":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁלֵה"}